+// The YAML 1.2 core schema and the YAML 1.1 types as regular expressions (spec 10.3.2; the
+// yaml-1.1 tag repository), plus the library's documented deviations (docs/03_options.md,
+// 10_yaml_syntax.md): no `y`/`n` booleans in 1.1, hex/octal/binary/sexagesimal ints in 1.1.
+const CORE_NULL = /^(~|[Nn]ull|NULL|)$/;
